{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"轉數快11月29日凌晨1時至早上11時暫停服務\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FPS-SUSPEND-261123-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】轉數快系統周日將會暫停服務，進行系統提升。</p><p>金管局表示，轉數快在11月29日凌晨1時至早上11時進行系統提升，期間會暫停服務。金管局已要求銀行及儲值支付工具營運商預早通知客戶相關安排，市民如有需要應提前為繳付項目作出安排。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.324479+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:10:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:43.928900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:26.277128+00:00","content_hash":"529476452374e165523c1c2cafcb57b69f2a62b97f31915318992eb0693d4ec0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}